### **Alternative: Digital Sensor (DS18B20)**
If using a **digital sensor (DS18B20)**, replace the analog read with **OneWire communication**:
```c
#include <OneWire.h>  // Library for DS18B20

OneWire ds(SENSOR_PIN);  // Initialize OneWire on the sensor pin

float readDS18B20() {
    byte data[12];
    ds.reset();
    ds.write(0xCC);  // Skip ROM (single sensor)
    ds.write(0x44);  // Start temperature conversion
    delay(750);      // Wait for conversion (750ms max)

    ds.reset();
    ds.write(0xCC);
    ds.write(0xBE);  // Read scratchpad

    for (int i = 0; i < 9; i++) {
        data[i] = ds.read();
    }

    int16_t rawTemp = (data[1] << 8) | data[0];  // Combine bytes
    return rawTemp * 0.0625;  // Convert to °C
}
```

